  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the project objective : Gender equality is a central policy concern that leads to the reduction of inequality and discrimination for Palestinian Women and girls
The expected effects for the target group of the Project are:  (Outcome).
Outcome 1 
Influence policies and build accountability for gender equality through effective research and analysis
The main planned products and/or services of the Project are: (Outputs ).   
1.1  Conduct evidence based researches
 1.2 Organize round table discussions
1.3 Media and advocacy material</narrative>
  </description>
